pragma solidity ^0.8.24;

// Contract behavioural tests are executed with pytest against the local Besu
// network (tests/test_blockchain_integration.py) and by compile-time ABI checks
// (tests/test_contract_compile.py). This file documents the intended cases:
// authorised registration, unauthorised registration, duplicate registration,
// revocation, key update and event emission.
